{"seq":32,"ts":1792791136040,"text":"\u001b[0;37;40m\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[1;36mNewhaven, Narrow Path\r\n\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[0;37;40m    This narrow path is fairly plain, save for the small lanterns hanging from\r\nthe trees around. North of you lies a strangely decorated shop, and a beat-up\r\nshack labeled \"General Store\" lies to your south. The path leads east and west\r\nfrom here. \r\n\u001b[0;32mObvious exits: nA\borth, sX\bouth, eR\bast, wN\best\r\n\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[0;37m[HP=40\u001b[0;37m]:"}
