{"seq":35,"ts":1792791137040,"text":"\u001b[0;37;40m\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[1;36mNewhaven, Village Entrance\r\n\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[0;37;40m    Welcome to Newhaven! You are standing at the crude wooden gates of the\r\nvillage entrance, in the middle of a dusty path. A low wooden palisade\r\nsurrounds the village, to protect against creatures of the night and random\r\nraiders. You can see small buildings to the north and south, and a dusty path\r\nthat leads to the west and southeast. \r\n\u001b[0;36mYou notice large sign, newbie manual here.\r\n\u001b[0;32mObvious exits: nA\borth, sX\bouth, wN\best, sK\boutheast\r\n\u001b[79D\u001b[K\u001b[0;37m[HP=40\u001b[0;37m]:"}
